{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfa3 <strong>My Fishing Desktop\u00a0</strong>\ud83c\udfa3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778670/extras/character_asesprite.gif?t=1750614209\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unwind and cast your worries away in <i><strong>My Fishing Desktop</strong></i>, the ultimate cozy desktop game where you can relax, catch a wide variety of fish, and immerse yourself in soothing ambience sounds. Whether you're chasing rare mythical catches or simply enjoying the peaceful atmosphere, this idle game is designed to help you chill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778670/extras/anchovy.png?t=1750614209\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778670/extras/anglerfish.png?t=1750614209\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778670/extras/bluegill.png?t=1750614209\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778670/extras/carp.png?t=1750614209\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778670/extras/flying_fish.png?t=1750614209\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778670/extras/moray_eel.png?t=1750614209\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778670/extras/perch.png?t=1750614209\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778670/extras/salmon.png?t=1750614209\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778670/extras/stingray.png?t=1750614209\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778670/extras/tuna.png?t=1750614209\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778670/extras/trout.png?t=1750614209\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0a <strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf8f Catch and collect fish from different rarities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb5 Set the mood with relaxing ambient sounds like rain, jungle, or vinyl crackle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde2 Unlock and wear charming  hats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u23f3 Let the game run while you do your important work (or not)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take a breath, drop your line, and let the world drift away.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3778670?t=1750614209","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778670/0dc53ecefc152e5e5f77409849c52c59929d0d0b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750614209","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778670/80525b317a3c9abbd4715cb55f705a3fad6b9169/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750614209","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778670/80525b317a3c9abbd4715cb55f705a3fad6b9169/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750614209","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":6